  "recipe": {
    "positive": "Visual style (follow exactly): in the style of David Shrigley's deliberately crude doodles. Deliberately awkward amateur computer doodle on plain white. Use wobbly interrupted mouse-like lines, absurdly inaccurate proportions, chunky crude flat fills that cross the outlines and slightly jagged pixels. The failed attempt at neatness should feel funny and intentional.",
